{"id":"word:hebrew:H6912","type":"word","title":"קָבַר","subtitle":"H6912 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to inter","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to קָבַר (H6912) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 133 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"קָבַר (qâbar) means to inter First listed occurrence: 1Chr 10 12."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"קָבַר","transliteration":"qâbar","pronunciation":"kaw-bar'","strong":"H6912","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6912","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["וַ/יִּקְבְּר֥וּ","וַ/יִּקָּבֵ֖ר","וַ/יִּקָּבֵ֥ר","וַ/יִּקְבְּר֣וּ","וַ/יִּקְבְּר֨וּ"],"morphs":[["HC/VNw3ms",27],["HC/Vqw3mp",23],["HC/Vqw3mp/Sp3ms",15],["HVqp3cp",6],["HR/Vqc",5],["HVNi3mp",5],["HC/Vqq3cp",3],["HC/Vqh1cs",3],["HVqv2ms",3],["HC/VNw3fs",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"to inter","usage":"× in any wise, bury(-ier).","full":"H6912. qabar קָבַר 132 verb bury (Late Hebrew id. ; Phoenician קבר , bury , קבר tomb; Arabic , Assyrian ‡ibiru , Aramaic קְבַר , , Nabataean קבר , all bury ; Palmyrene Nabataean קברא tomb , so Sabean קבר Hom Chrest. 126 , Lihyanian קבר bury , DHM Epigr. Denkm. No, 35, 2, 3 , compare מקבר(הםׅ burial- place CIS iv,No, 20, 1.2, 4 ); — Qal 86 Perfect 3masculine singular ׳ק Gen 23:19 ; 2 masculine singular Sf. consecutive וּקְבַרְתַּנְי 47:30 , etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular וַיִּקְבֹּד Deut 34:6 ; 2Kin 21:26 , etc.; Imperative קְבֹר Gen 23:6 +, etc.; Infinitive absolute קָבוֺר Deut 21:23 ; construct לִקְכּוֺר Jer 19:11 +, etc.; Participle active קֹבֵר 2Kin 9:10 +, etc.; pass . קָבוּר 1Kin 13:31 , plural קְבֻרִים Eccl 8:10 bury , acc. person, bones, etc., usually with ב location, 2Sam 2:32 ; 1Kin 13:31 (twice in verse); Gen 23:6 ; Josh 24:30 , 32 (twice in verse); Judg 2:9 33t.; with בֵּיתוֺ location 2Chr 33:20 ( בְּגַןבֵּֿיתוֺ || 2Kin 21:18 , also בְּבֵיתוֺ 1Sam 25:1 ; 1Kin 2:34 ); with שָׁם Num 11:34 , תַּחַת 1Sam 31:13 = 1Chr 10:12 ; pregnantly with אֶל location Gen 23:19 ; 25:9 ; Ezek 39:15 ; אֶלאֲֿבֹתָ֑י Gen 49:29 ; compare עִםאֲֿבוֺתָיו 2 Kings 12:22; 2Kin 15:7 ; 2Chr 25:28 ; 26:23 (see also Niph`al , and אֲבֹתֶיךָ אֶלֿ תָּבוֺא Gen 15:15 ); with שָׁ֫תָּה 23:13 ; 49:31 (3 t. in verse); 50:5 ; with accusative of person Alone 2Sam 2:4-5 , 22 t.; + מִלְּפָנַי Gen 23:4 , 8 ; passive Eccl 8:10 ; accusative omitted 2Kin 9:10 3 t. + (with ב ) 2Sam 4:12 . Niph`al 30 Imperfect 3masculine singular יִקָּבֵר Jer 22:19 , etc.; &#8212; be buried Gen 15:15 Jer 8:2 ; 16:4-5 , 25:33 (+ אסף ), so read perhaps Ezek 29:5 for תִּקָּבֵץ (+ id. ); יִקּ חֲמוֺר ׳קְבֻרַת Jer 22:19 ; usually with ב location Gen 35:19 ; Judg 8:32 6 t. Judges; 2Sam 17:23 ; 1Kin 2:10 , 34 16 t. Kings Chronicles (+ עִםאֲֿבוֺתָיו 14:31 ; 15:24 6 t.; יִשְׂר ׳עִםמַֿלְכֵי 2Kin 13:13 ; 14:16 ); with שָׁם Num 20:1 3 t.; with מִתַּחַת תַּחַת, Gen 35:8 . Pi`el bury (in masses), with accusative: Imperfect 3feminine singular suffix תְּקַכְּרֵם Hosea 9:6 ; Infinitive construct לְקַבֵּר 1Kin 11:15 ; Participle plural מְקַכְּרִים Num 33:4 ; Ezek 39:14 ; as intensive noun, of office, burier , singular מְקַכֵּר Jer 14:16 , plural ׳הַמּ Ezek 39:15 . Pu`al Perfect 3masculine singular אַבְרָהָם קֻבַּר שָׁ֫מָּה Gen 25:10 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 10 12","keyReferences":["1Chr 10 12","1Kgs 2 10","1Kgs 2 31","1Kgs 2 34","1Kgs 11 15","1Kgs 11 43","1Kgs 13 29","1Kgs 13 31"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":133,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 10 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":10,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּקְבְּר֨וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 2 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":2,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּקָּבֵ֖ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/VNw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 2 31","book":"1Kgs","chapter":2,"verse":31,"englishText"